{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）早上7時15分，警方接獲多人報案，指大角咀海帆道11號對開爆水管，據報水柱有7層樓高。人員到場調查，相信是一條直徑600毫米的鹹水管爆裂，隨即關水掣維修。</p><p>現場可見，水柱在凱帆軒對開的行人路地面激射而出，直衝半空約10多米高；水花再灑落，宛如噴泉，地面磚塊碇開，大量積水蔓延至行人路及部分車道，車輛要涉水而行。維修工人已經到場處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"水柱直衝半空。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159411717361373184014239.jpeg/ElvhszpNCxOdZkvbO8D5wrq50JoaQ9i2Oq71-x-u9fs\"/><figcaption>水柱直衝半空。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"水柱直衝半空。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159411511681093632296135.jpeg/WOaEfvXY7Bo0oPJ4IlkMaWpkupFxDEOiYUGM2URBjNk\"/><figcaption>水柱直衝半空。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"水柱直衝半空。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159411514864701440234051.jpeg/SsJyWCW3c9w9IGBXRp2t4HCjpwMle15_mPwh8L38IfA\"/><figcaption>水柱直衝半空。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"行經車輛需要涉水而行。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159411517544992768408129.jpeg/3vKB3OU7C6mb2L0ibks7YAIr73tS3GP1JcgHJgDIByY\"/><figcaption>行經車輛需要涉水而行。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"凱帆軒到開爆水管。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159411520376279040201896.jpeg/qrXQ_nN9-TToLYRALGF60DzPlrVpg_Vz8FwC-9VcAvs\"/><figcaption>凱帆軒到開爆水管。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"水務署人員到場關閉水掣。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159411523291451392120569.jpeg/FYT4-z4SFqwht_GPX-hPCNssfHnB3Iulq_c_nY73P50\"/><figcaption>水務署人員到場關閉水掣。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T00:39:32.187799+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}